1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,639
Part 2 As chair of the town council subcommittee on park facilities,

2
00:00:04,639 --> 00:00:13,530
I'd like to bring you up to date on some of the changes that have been made recently to the Croft Valley Park.

3
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:17,900
So if you could just take a look at the map I handed out

4
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,000
let's begin with a general overview.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,304
So the basic arrangement of the park hasn't changed -

6
00:00:25,304 --> 00:00:32,000
it still has two gates, north and south, and a lake in the middle.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,680
The café continues to serve an assortment of drinks and snacks

8
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,448
and is still in the same place,

9
00:00:39,448 --> 00:00:44,000
looking out over the lake and next to the old museum.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,231
We're hoping to change the location of the toilets,

11
00:00:47,231 --> 00:00:54,410
and bring them nearer to the centre of the park as they're a bit out of the way at present,

12
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:58,000
near the adventure playground, in the corner of your map.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,580
The formal gardens have been replanted

14
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:05,010
and should be at their best in a month or two.

15
00:01:05,010 --> 00:01:08,420
They used to be behind the old museum

16
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:13,046
but we've now used the space near the south gate -

17
00:01:13,046 --> 00:01:20,190
between the park boundary and the path that goes past the lake towards the old museum.

18
00:01:20,190 --> 00:01:25,540
We have a new outdoor gym for adults and children

19
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:28,810
which is already proving very popular.

20
00:01:28,810 --> 00:01:36,000
It's by the glass houses, just to the right of the path from the south gate.

21
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,000
You have to look for it as it's a bit hidden in the trees.

22
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,210
One very successful introduction has been our skateboard ramp.

23
00:01:47,210 --> 00:01:52,200
It's in constant use during the evenings and holidays.

24
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,460
It's near the old museum,

25
00:01:54,460 --> 00:02:03,500
at the end of a little path that leads off from the main path between the lake and the museum.

26
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:11,800
We've also introduced a new area for wild flowers, to attract bees and butterflies.

27
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:17,580
It's on a bend in the path that goes round the east side of the lake

28
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:21,000
just south of the adventure playground.

29
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Now let me tell you a bit more about some of the changes to Croft Valley Park.

30
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,750
One of our most exciting developments has been the adventure playground.

31
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:38,203
We were aware that we had nowhere for children to let off steam,

32
00:02:38,203 --> 00:02:48,270
and decided to use our available funds to set up a completely new facility in a large space to the north of the park.

33
00:02:48,270 --> 00:02:53,600
It's open year-round, though it closes early in the winter months

34
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:57,100
and entrance is completely free.

35
00:02:57,100 --> 00:03:00,956
Children can choose whatever activities they want to do,

36
00:03:00,956 --> 00:03:08,240
irrespective of their age, but we do ask adults not to leave them on their own there.

37
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:11,840
There are plenty of seats where parents can relax

38
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:15,560
and keep an eye on their children at the same time.

39
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:19,000
Lastly, the glass houses.

40
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:29,440
A huge amount of work has been done on them to repair the damage following the disastrous fire that recently destroyed their western side.

41
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:36,080
Over £80,000 was spent on replacing the glass walls and the metal supports,

42
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:40,348
as well as the plants that had been destroyed,

43
00:03:40,348 --> 00:03:48,410
although unfortunately the collection of tropical palm trees has proved too expensive to replace up to now.

44
00:03:48,410 --> 00:03:55,358
At present the glass houses are open from 10am to 3pm Mondays to Thursdays,

45
00:03:55,358 --> 00:04:00,320
and it's hoped to extend this to the weekend soon.

46
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:05,300
We're grateful to all those who helped us by contributing their time

47
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:07,700
and money to this achievement.

48
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:09,000
The gardens have...
